      "widgets_values": [
        "MOSS Base INT8 ConvRot · separated components\n\nUse ComfyUI 0.42.1 or newer. Native MOSS support was added in 0.42.0; 0.42.1 fixes crashes affecting the MOSS template. Desktop: update the engine for this instance through Manage > Update, then restart. No nightly engine is required.\n\nmodels/diffusion_models/moss_image_base_int8_convrot.safetensors\nmodels/text_encoders/qwen3.5_9b_int8_convrot.safetensors\nmodels/vae/flux2-vae_small.safetensors\n\nCLIP type: moss_image. Weight dtype: default. Native MOSS shift 5; do not add ModelSamplingSD3. 25 steps, CFG 2.5, er_sde/simple and SLG (single layer 22, start 0, end 0.5) follow the Comfy-Org Base template. Prompt upsampling is off to preserve Palette text. This is Base, not an 8-step Turbo recipe. Prompt Palette controls the connected seed.\n\nhttps://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/main/templates/image_moss_image_base_t2i.json\n\nGraph wiring and real checkpoint-header detection checked; GPU loading/inference not run here."
